  (descr "CT-3030SUR660+850C-PT dual-die 660nm + 850nm emitter, SMD3030-4P. Land pattern per Chongtian datasheet rev A1 2025-09-18: left column 1.78mm wide (2.35mm tall overall), right column 1.03mm wide (2.20mm tall overall), 0.4mm gaps. Package 3.2 x 3.0 x 0.63mm. PADS: 1=850 anode, 2=850 cathode, 3=660 anode, 4=660 cathode. NOTE the die offset: the 850 die sits in the upper half of the 3mm emitting circle and the 660 die in the lower half, roughly +/-0.75mm from package centre - orient so this offset is PERPENDICULAR to the source-detector axis.")
